# .env.example — DO NOT COMMIT SECRETS TO THE REPOSITORY
# This file is a template for local development only.
# Copy it to a local .env file and fill in your real secrets there.

# Example:
# EBAY_APP_ID=your-ebay-app-id
# EBAY_CLIENT_SECRET=your-ebay-client-secret
# PORT=5000

# The real .env with secrets should NOT be committed. If you previously committed secrets,
# rotate/revoke them immediately and remove them from the repository history.
